    <string name="lists_header">Lists</string>
    <string name="disclaimer">JagtFokus shows open seasons from the hunting regulations, the date and the place you pick. The list may be incomplete or out of date. Special rules (area, sex, quota, hunting method) are in the note and in the law. You are responsible for hunting legally.</string>
    <string name="daylight">As a rule you may hunt only between sunrise and sunset. The app shows sun times, but does not check the clock.</string>
